  "qualificationScope": "Mac signed F2 built G1=G2=G3 from the current 18-module core, with byte-identical container and native code. Changes seed/21-check and seed/30-lower (JUN-734): a def of a vector / map literal with f64 / boolean values or map-literal items takes the computed-def route; the variadic assoc is reader sugar for nested assoc; (get m k) on a typed map is [:option V] (lowered as typed-map-get); (:k m d) on a typed map is (get m :k d); a defrecord name as a bare parameter type is refused E2105. Programs without these forms are unchanged. Native ARM packed/core, native x86, controller, public aliases, cold C0, performance, release and physical qualification remain separate.",
